OL,3,GNEWSAHeatwave blamed for sudden city
OL,4,Acentre branch fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe collapse of part of a prominent
OL,7,Fcity centre tree which sent shoppers
OL,8,Frushing to safety has been blamed on
OL,9,Fthe stress caused by a succession of
OL,10,Fheatwaves.
OL,12,FThe city council said the Tree of
OL,13,FHeaven in New George Street off Armada
OL,14,FWay in Plymouth was last inspected in
OL,15,FJuly but would now be removed as "we
OL,16,Fnow believe the tree has sustained too
OL,17,Fmuch damage" after the incident at
OL,18,Fabout 11:00 BST on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
