OL,3,GNEWSAHeatwave blamed for sudden city
OL,4,Acentre branch fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson said: "Like most trees
OL,7,Fup and down the country, it will have
OL,8,Fbeen suffering from heat stress due to
OL,9,Fthe ongoing high temperatures we are
OL,10,Fexperiencing."
OL,12,FMilad Mettrey who runs the  Fabulous
OL,13,FFalafel food stand close to the tree
OL,14,Fsaid: "I heard a noise like a gun."
